{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶領觀眾深入灣仔與尖沙咀，由「星級飯腳」阮兆祥與蔡景行呈獻正宗陝西風味，到探索堅持手作的山東傳統餃子，再品嚐由泰國進駐香港的人氣 Gelato，帶大家一覽多款滋味美食！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站由阮兆祥（祥仔）帶領蔡景行（行仔）來到灣仔一間內地相當知名、近日開設香港分店的陝西西安本土美食餐館。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8a9270ab-be55-4e56-9a77-e7246ba4d0bd.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20265eOLGsQjOm1790759523.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8a9270ab-be55-4e56-9a77-e7246ba4d0bd.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"139d92db-4201-401b-887e-8c592c54cb94.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026bLGmw3iE951790759523.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"139d92db-4201-401b-887e-8c592c54cb94.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0a15454d-4f9a-4c7f-836d-6aff85c1396a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026eTcmPkGgSb1790759524.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0a15454d-4f9a-4c7f-836d-6aff85c1396a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"41e827b3-cd93-4e02-89a1-0d79c6f061bb.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20263Qw6NEgPxy1790759524.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"41e827b3-cd93-4e02-89a1-0d79c6f061bb.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"224c791f-e123-4995-9f40-d0d2fb000cd9.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026w5RP35yzHS1790759524.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"224c791f-e123-4995-9f40-d0d2fb000cd9.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由林映暉與波波（黃婧靈）來到灣仔皇后大道東，發掘一間堅持手工製作的山東傳統餃子店。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bafb9103-455a-44c7-a25b-b6899b5e393b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026D2R2kFSHA91790759525.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bafb9103-455a-44c7-a25b-b6899b5e393b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c6da6633-1243-40ad-ab99-9a9f36d0eb9d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026iDOCwyN7PW1790759525.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c6da6633-1243-40ad-ab99-9a9f36d0eb9d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"36ba10bb-3eb8-444a-a37c-83beb0269827.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Z4xC9p2Nx01790759526.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"36ba10bb-3eb8-444a-a37c-83beb0269827.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">最後，陳若思（Amber）與葉靖儀（Michelle）來到尖沙咀，造訪一間由泰國登陸香港的人氣 Gelato 店，慕名品嚐香港限定口味。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"46ccf3ae-b16e-47d2-bc4a-b64811fdf582.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20263lJP0qrTRK1790759526.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"46ccf3ae-b16e-47d2-bc4a-b64811fdf582.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"87137f8e-e658-427f-9589-494b3a0dd3dc.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026jEGBId4tte1790759526.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"87137f8e-e658-427f-9589-494b3a0dd3dc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T14:39:00.066644+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":259,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}